OL,3,GNEWSASecond teen charged with attempted
OL,4,Amurder over stabbing                   
OL,6,FA second teenager has been charged with
OL,7,Fattempted murder after an 18-year-old  
OL,8,Fman was seriously injured in a stabbing
OL,9,Fin Liverpool city centre.              
OL,11,FA 16-year-old boy from Wavertree, who  
OL,12,Fcannot be named for legal reasons, has 
OL,13,Falready been charged with attempted    
OL,14,Fmurder and possession of a bladed      
OL,15,Farticle in a public place.             
OL,17,FMerseyside Police said 19-year-old     
OL,18,FMajeed Habibi, of Stanley Road, Bootle,
OL,19,Fhas now been charged with the same     
OL,20,Foffences.                              
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
