OL,3,GNEWSASecond teen charged with attempted
OL,4,Amurder over stabbing                   
OL,6,FThe force said the victim had been     
OL,7,Fseriously injured in the attack around 
OL,8,F21:00 GMT on 15 November, but has now  
OL,9,Frecovered and is in a stable condition.
OL,10,FHe has been discharged from hospital.  
